991/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2022-10-10T19:17:44Z","updated_at":"2023-01-13T00:03:56Z","closed_at":"2023-01-13T00:03:56Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-3815](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-3815)\r\n### Description\n\n1. Create a table\r\n\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# CREATE TABLE mytable (id INT);\r\n```\r\n\r\n2. Introduce error injection\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# SET yb_test_fail_next_ddl=true;\r\n```\r\n\r\n3. Perform failing Rename\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# ALTER TABLE mytable RENAME TO my1;\r\nERROR:  Failing DDL operation as requested.           \r\n```\r\n\r\n4. However there exists a mapping to \"my1\" still??\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# CREATE TABLE my1 (id INT);\r\nERROR:  relation \"my1\" already exists\r\n```\r\n\r\n5. Note that I can select from both names:\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# SELECT * FROM my1;\r\n id \r\n----\r\n(0 rows)\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# SELECT * FROM mytable;\r\n id \r\n----\r\n(0 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever in a new connection, the error does not exist:\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# CREATE TABLE my1 (id INT);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThus this looks like an issue with clearing of caches.","closed_by":{"login":"m-iancu","id":4038003,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMzgwMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4038003?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu","html_url":"http